{"path":"utility/program/quick_exit","title":"std::quick_exit","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>quick_exit","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/program/quick_exit","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Causes normal program termination to occur without completely cleaning the resources.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cstdlib\">&lt;cstdlib&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span>noreturn<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> quick_exit<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> exit_code <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Causes normal program termination to occur without completely cleaning the resources.\n</p><p>Functions passed to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/at_quick_exit\">std::at_quick_exit</a></span> are called in reverse order of their registration. If an exception tries to propagate out of any of the functions, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/terminate\">std::terminate</a></span> is called. After calling the registered functions, calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/_Exit\"><span class=\"kw972\">std::_Exit</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>exit_code<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>Functions passed to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/atexit\">std::atexit</a></span> are not called.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> exit_code\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> exit status of the program\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdlib&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> quick_exit_handler<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"quick_exit handler #\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> N <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/endl\"><span class=\"kw1807\">std::<span class=\"me2\">endl</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// flush is intended</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> at_exit_handler<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"at_exit handler<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/at_quick_exit\"><span class=\"kw974\">std::<span class=\"me2\">at_quick_exit</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>quick_exit_handler<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">||</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/at_quick_exit\"><span class=\"kw974\">std::<span class=\"me2\">at_quick_exit</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>quick_exit_handler<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cerr\"><span class=\"kw1776\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cerr</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Registration failed<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/EXIT_status\"><span class=\"kw976\">EXIT_FAILURE</span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/atexit\"><span class=\"kw973\">std::<span class=\"me2\">atexit</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>at_exit_handler<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// the handler will not be called</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> R <span class=\"br0\">{</span> ~R<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"destructor<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span> resource<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*...*/</span>\n&nbsp;\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">quick_exit</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/EXIT_status\"><span class=\"kw975\">EXIT_SUCCESS</span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"This statement is unreachable...<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>quick_exit handler #2\nquick_exit handler #1</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/abort\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>abort</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  causes abnormal program termination (without cleaning up) <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/exit\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>exit</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  causes normal program termination with cleaning up <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/atexit\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>atexit</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  registers a function to be called on <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/exit\">std::exit()</a></span> invocation <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/at_quick_exit\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>at_quick_exit</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  registers a function to be called on <span class=\"t-lc\"><strong class=\"selflink\">std::quick_exit</strong></span> invocation <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/program/quick_exit\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>quick_exit</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/program","title":"Program support utilities"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::quick_exit","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Causes normal program termination to occur without completely cleaning the resources."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"exit_code"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"abort","note":"causes abnormal program termination (without cleaning up)"},{"label":"exit","note":"causes normal program termination with cleaning up"},{"label":"atexit","note":"registers a function to be called on std::exit() invocation"},{"label":"at_quick_exit","note":"registers a function to be called on std::quick_exit invocation"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":204,"codeBlockCount":2}
